ut stars never ask when they’re ready to move"},{"s":8.67,"e":12.37,"text":"I wore their warnings like weight on my wings"},{"s":12.37,"e":15.82,"text":"Silenced my shine for the safety it brings"},{"s":15.82,"e":19.52,"text":"Then you found fire where fear used to freeze"},{"s":19.52,"e":23.21,"text":"Said, “Love isn’t living if love needs a key”"},{"s":23.21,"e":26.09,"text":"We left every label and limit below"},{"s":26.09,"e":29.46,"text":"Two restless hearts with a reason to glow"},{"s":29.46,"e":32.99,"text":"No map for the heavens, no lock on the blue"},{"s":32.99,"e":36.27,"text":"The night made an opening—I ran into you"},{"s":36.27,"e":39.64,"text":"Let the cold world question our collision"},{"s":39.64,"e":43.09,"text":"We don’t need their blessing or permission"},{"s":43.09,"e":45.8,"text":"Every scar became a constellation"},{"s":45.8,"e":48.92,"text":"Every heartbeat signed our declaration"},{"s":48.92,"e":51.88,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine"},{"s":51.88,"e":54.35,"text":"Your universe is touching mine"},{"s":54.35,"e":58.45,"text":"Let them draw their borders—we’ll cross every line"},{"s":58.45,"e":61.41,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine"},{"s":61.41,"e":64.94,"text":"No chains on the moon, no claims on the sky"},{"s":64.94,"e":68.8,"text":"No judge gets to tell these comets where to fly"},{"s":68.8,"e":73.16,"text":"If loving you is lightning, let it light up the night"},{"s":73.16,"e":76.11,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine"},{"s":76.11,"e":76.77,"text":"Look—"},{"s":76.77,"e":80.8,"text":"They tried to put a ceiling where the galaxy grew"},{"s":80.8,"e":85.15,"text":"Told me play it safe, but I was made to break through"},{"s":85.15,"e":89.83,"text":"Had a pocket full of pressure, carried pain like a planet"},{"s":89.83,"e":94.43,"text":"You took my darkest damage, made a diamond understand it"},{"s":94.43,"e":99.44,"text":"Now we’re dancing through dimensions, no decision from a jury"},{"s":99.44,"e":104.86,"text":"They can question every step, but they can’t cancel what is worthy"},{"s":104.86,"e":109.05,"text":"I was buried under doubt, you uncovered every ember"},{"s":109.05,"e":113.57,"text":"Now forever feels familiar every time we stand together"},{"s":113.57,"e":117.27,"text":"No approval, no apology, our orbit is our own"},{"s":117.27,"e":122.03,"text":"Built a heaven from the rubble, made the wilderness a home"},{"s":122.03,"e":126.8,"text":"If tomorrow turns to thunder, I’ll be shelter in the storm"},{"s":126.8,"e":132.13,"text":"You don’t need to fit their future—you were born to form your own"},{"s":132.13,"e":136.08,"text":"Woman: Let the cold world question our collision"},{"s":136.08,"e":139.94,"text":"Man: We don’t need their blessing or permission"},{"s":139.94,"e":143.22,"text":"Woman: Every scar became a constellation"},{"s":143.22,"e":147.17,"text":"Together: Every heartbeat signed our declaration"},{"s":147.17,"e":150.12,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine"},{"s":150.12,"e":152.59,"text":"Your universe is touching mine"},{"s":152.59,"e":156.7,"text":"Let them draw their borders—we’ll cross every line"},{"s":156.7,"e":159.65,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine"},{"s":159.65,"e":163.18,"text":"No chains on the moon, no claims on the sky"},{"s":163.18,"e":167.05,"text":"No judge gets to tell these comets where to fly"},{"s":167.05,"e":171.4,"text":"If loving you is lightning, let it light up the night"},{"s":171.4,"e":174.36,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine"},{"s":174.36,"e":178.63,"text":"Woman: If the sky falls, we’ll fashion it into wings"},{"s":178.63,"e":182.49,"text":"Man: If the fear calls, we’ll answer like kings"},{"s":182.49,"e":184.62,"text":"Woman: If the door closes—"},{"s":184.62,"e":187.33,"text":"Man: We’ll dance through the wall"},{"s":187.33,"e":191.44,"text":"Together: We were never made for permission at all"},{"s":191.44,"e":195.8,"text":"Woman: Let the violins rise, let the violet light run"},{"s":195.8,"e":199.33,"text":"Man: Two souls, one sky, outshining the sun"},{"s":199.33,"e":203.85,"text":"Together: From the edge of existence, our voices align—"},{"s":203.85,"e":205.9,"text":"We don’t need permission…"},{"s":205.9,"e":208.94,"text":"STARS DON’T NEED PERMISSION TO SHINE!"},{"s":208.94,"e":211.48,"text":"Your universe is touching mine!"},{"s":211.48,"e":215.59,"text":"Let them draw their borders—we’ll cross every line"},{"s":215.59,"e":218.63,"text":"Stars don’t need permission to shine!"},{"s":218.63,"e":222.16,"text":"No chains on the moon, no claims on the sky"},{"s":222.16,"e":226.02,"text":"No judge gets to tell these comets where to fly"},{"s":226.02,"e":230.38,"text":"If loving you is lightning, let it light up the night"},{"s":230.38,"e":232.68,"text":"Stars don’t need permission—"},{"s":232.68,"e":234.48,"text":"WE WERE BORN TO SHINE!"},{"s":234.48,"e":238.18,"text":"They told us, “Wait for the world to approve”"},{"s":238.18,"e":239.82,"text":"But stars never ask…"},{"s":239.82,"e":241.22,"text":"They simply move."}],"duration":241.72,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}